**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.git
**/.playwright-mcp
**/*.user
.env

# Angular CLI build cache — grows to several GB and is rebuilt inside the image anyway.
# Without this the daemon transfers the whole cache on every build (minutes of "load build context").
**/.angular

# Other local-only artefacts that must never reach the build context.
**/TestResults
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/logs
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store
